          <p>I work backward from the address: price band, property type, HOA if any, and how your income and assets look on paper. That way your offer lines up with what underwriting will actually support. For zip-level context and neighborhood notes, start with my <a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/torrance-homes/" style="color:var(--sky);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">Torrance homes</a> guide, then let’s connect it to a real pre-approval.</p>
